HC_SeenText_A2_0:
	text "Welcome, friend!"
	line "Everything here is"
	para "free. Including"
	line "this beating."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_1:
	text "We have no locks"
	line "here. Nobody has"
	para "ever needed one."
	line "Please do not make"
	para "me start."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_2:
	text "Sharing is caring."
	line "I'd like to share"
	para "my Pokemon with"
	line "your face."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_3:
	text "I traded a basket"
	line "of nuts for this"
	para "team. Best deal I"
	line "never made."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_4:
	text "Clothes are"
	line "optional here. So"
	para "is manners,"
	line "apparently."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_5:
	text "We don't have"
	line "money. We have"
	para "vibes. And a"
	line "hundred mushrooms"
	para "I can't identify."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_6:
	text "I was a"
	line "stockbroker once."
	para "Then I found the"
	line "berry. Now I fight"
	para "strangers in a"
	line "field."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_7:
	text "Ever think a"
	line "cooked meal is"
	para "just a raw meal"
	line "that gave up?"
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_8:
	text "The elders say a"
	line "stranger brings"
	para "change. You look"
	line "like a lot of"
	para "change."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_9:
	text "Join the commune!"
	line "The initiation is"
	para "a battle. And the"
	line "other thing, but"
	para "later."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_10:
	text "I forage. I"
	line "gather. I punch."
	para "It's a cycle."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_11:
	text "We have"
	line "thirty-seven words"
	para "for rain and one"
	line "for fighting. Hit"
	para "me."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_12:
	text "Don't mind the"
	line "smell. It's the"
	para "compost. Also me."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_13:
	text "My partners and I"
	line "are in an open"
	para "relationship with"
	line "the whole forest."
	para "Mostly the"
	line "squirrels."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_14:
	text "No one owns"
	line "anything here."
	para "That bone you're"
	line "holding is mine,"
	para "by the way."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_15:
	text "I came here to"
	line "find myself. Turns"
	para "out I'm in a bush."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_16:
	text "Plenty of food and"
	line "no landlords."
	para "What's the catch?"
	line "Me. I'm the catch."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_17:
	text "You're wearing so"
	line "many layers. Let"
	para "me help with"
	line "those. By force."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_18:
	text "My guru says"
	line "restrictive"
	para "boundaries are"
	line "Ahrimanic. I'm"
	para "still working out"
	line "what that means."
	para "Fight me about it."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_19:
	text "Where's your"
	line "tribe? No tribe?"
	para "Then I adopt you."
	line "After this."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_20:
	text "I haven't worn"
	line "shoes in six"
	para "years. My feet are"
	line "armor. My Pokemon"
	para "are armor."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_21:
	text "The river"
	line "provides. The"
	para "forest provides."
	line "You provide a"
	para "challenge."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_22:
	text "I'm a monogamy"
	line "evangelist. They"
	para "fed me berries and"
	line "now I have six"
	para "boyfriends. Pray"
	line "for me."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_23:
	text "I audit"
	line "relationships for"
	para "a living. Yours is"
	line "a disaster. Let me"
	para "take that out on"
	line "your team."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_24:
	text "We believe in"
	line "total honesty."
	para "Your team is"
	line "mediocre. Your"
	para "aura is mediocre."
	line "Your shoes are"
	para "mediocre."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_25:
	text "There is a"
	line "sunscreen"
	para "shortage. I am"
	line "very upset. You"
	para "will pay for it."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_26:
	text "I made this team"
	line "from scratch. And"
	para "by scratch I mean"
	line "I found it in a"
	para "ditch."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_27:
	text "Everyone here"
	line "loves everyone."
	para "Except you. You"
	line "I'm still deciding"
	para "about."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_28:
	text "Do you like sauna?"
	line "No? Then you're"
	para "going to love"
	line "this."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_29:
	text "I once ate a"
	line "mushroom and met"
	para "my father. He's a"
	line "tree now. Get out"
	para "of his way."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_30:
	text "The commune has no"
	line "police. The"
	para "commune has me."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_31:
	text "We don't believe"
	line "in sin. We believe"
	para "in consequences."
	line "You are about to"
	para "meet them."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_32:
	text "I've been"
	line "gathering my"
	para "thoughts all"
	line "morning. Here,"
	para "take them. Take"
	line "them all."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_33:
	text "Every night we sit"
	line "in a circle and"
	para "share our"
	line "feelings. Tonight"
	para "it's your turn,"
	line "with my fists."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_34:
	text "We heal with herbs"
	line "and fire. And with"
	para "the occasional"
	line "punch. Mostly the"
	para "punch."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_35:
	text "I used to be a"
	line "lawyer. Now I"
	para "weave. I'm better"
	line "at both than I"
	para "was."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_36:
	text "You smell like"
	line "money. We don't"
	para "like that here."
	line "Wash it off. In my"
	para "fight."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_37:
	text "I'm told I"
	line "overshare. I had"
	para "no idea. Anyway,"
	line "here's my team."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_38:
	text "A man tried to"
	line "build a fence here"
	para "once. We ate him."
	line "Gently."
	para "Spiritually."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_39:
	text "I'm very, very"
	line "relaxed. Which is"
	para "a lot of"
	line "confidence for"
	para "what's about to"
	line "happen."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_40:
	text "We have a policy"
	line "of radical"
	para "acceptance. Which"
	line "means I accept"
	para "that you're going"
	line "to lose."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_41:
	text "Everyone is"
	line "welcome here, even"
	para "rude people."
	line "Especially rude"
	para "people. We have a"
	line "berry for that."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_42:
	text "Careful, the grass"
	line "is damp and I'm"
	para "not wearing much."
	line "I'm still going to"
	para "win."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_43:
	text "I like how you"
	line "look at me. No,"
	para "wait. That's fear."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_44:
	text "No time to talk,"
	line "I'm on my second"
	para "breakfast. Have a"
	line "battle."
	done

HC_SeenText_A2_45:
	text "Do you know what"
	line "happens to people"
	para "who don't gather?"
	line "They hunt. Hello."
