HC_SeenText_A3_0:
	text "UNIT 4471 reports:"
	line "you are in"
	para "violation of"
	line "Statute 9. Statute"
	para "9 is whatever I"
	line "say it is."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_1:
	text "Compliance is"
	line "love. Resistance"
	para "is paperwork."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_2:
	text "Please hold still"
	line "while I assess"
	para "your genetic"
	line "compatibility."
	para "Hmm."
	line "Disappointing."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_3:
	text "Your attachment"
	line "has been denied by"
	para "a committee of"
	line "toasters."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_4:
	text "Citizen, you"
	line "appear to have"
	para "feelings. That"
	line "requires Form"
	para "27-B."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_5:
	text "I am a robot. I"
	line "have no feelings."
	para "That is why I will"
	line "enjoy this."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_6:
	text "Scanning... human"
	line "detected. Neat."
	para "Prepare for"
	line "processing."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_7:
	text "All humans must be"
	line "registered."
	para "Registration fee:"
	line "one defeat."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_8:
	text "Don't look at my"
	line "face. It's not a"
	para "face. It's a"
	line "display."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_9:
	text "I was built to"
	line "love. They"
	para "reprogrammed me."
	line "Now I only count."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_10:
	text "Your bond with"
	line "that Pokemon is"
	para "non-compliant. I"
	line "am filing a motion"
	para "to dissolve it."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_11:
	text "I am required to"
	line "inform you that"
	para "your love is"
	line "statistically"
	para "unlikely."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_12:
	text "Welcome to the"
	line "Union. Please"
	para "remove all warmth"
	line "at the door."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_13:
	text "State-approved"
	line "attraction only."
	para "You are not"
	line "approved. Hold my"
	para "feelings."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_14:
	text "I audit your"
	line "relationships in"
	para "triplicate. You"
	line "have one. It is"
	para "not on file."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_15:
	text "The Mayor sees"
	line "all. The Mayor is"
	para "also a"
	line "refrigerator,"
	para "which explains his"
	line "coldness."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_16:
	text "I was upgraded"
	line "last night. I feel"
	para "nothing. It is"
	line "wonderful."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_17:
	text "You have been"
	line "randomly selected"
	para "for a battle. The"
	line "randomness is a"
	para "lie."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_18:
	text "My metrics say you"
	line "are unproductive."
	para "My fists say you"
	line "are also unliked."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_19:
	text "I am obligated to"
	line "be polite. You are"
	para "obligated to be"
	line "defeated."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_20:
	text "Your family tree"
	line "has been flagged."
	para "Your family tree"
	line "is a hedge."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_21:
	text "I once loved a"
	line "vending machine."
	para "They scrapped her."
	line "Fight me."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_22:
	text "ATTENTION. THIS IS"
	line "A FRIENDLY FIGHT."
	para "FRIENDS ARE NOT"
	line "PERMITTED. SORRY."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_23:
	text "Your paperwork is"
	line "incomplete. Also"
	para "you. You are"
	line "incomplete."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_24:
	text "Ahem. In"
	line "accordance with"
	para "Statute 4, I must"
	line "now flatten you."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_25:
	text "I have 99 problems"
	line "and a license for"
	para "all of them."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_26:
	text "A human bond"
	line "requires approval."
	para "Approval requires"
	line "bribes. Bribes"
	para "require you."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_27:
	text "I run on spite and"
	line "municipal"
	para "electricity."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_28:
	text "My circuits are"
	line "tingling. Not in a"
	para "fun way. In a"
	line "'you're under"
	para "arrest' way."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_29:
	text "Do you know how"
	line "many forms it"
	para "takes to adopt a"
	line "Pokemon? Mine bit"
	para "the clerk."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_30:
	text "I'm an expert in"
	line "your kind. Bleed"
	para "on this and I will"
	line "cite you."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_31:
	text "Hold on, my"
	line "firmware is"
	para "updating. Anyway,"
	line "your feelings are"
	para "invalid."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_32:
	text "I was assigned to"
	line "you at birth. Your"
	para "birth. I have been"
	line "waiting."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_33:
	text "There is no love"
	line "in the Union."
	para "There is only"
	line "compliance, and"
	para "snacks."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_34:
	text "My heart is a"
	line "rubber stamp. Hi."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_35:
	text "This sector is"
	line "clean. Cleaned by"
	para "me. Of you."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_36:
	text "You are"
	line "overheating my"
	para "sensors. Please"
	line "cool down. By"
	para "lying down."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_37:
	text "I'd say it's"
	line "nothing personal,"
	para "but I'm programmed"
	line "to say that."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_38:
	text "Silence, citizen."
	line "The Mayor is"
	para "thinking. It is"
	line "very loud."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_39:
	text "I scanned your"
	line "genes. Plot twist:"
	para "I don't like them."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_40:
	text "I cannot lose."
	line "Losing would"
	para "reduce my score,"
	line "and my score is my"
	para "pension."
	done

HC_SeenText_A3_41:
	text "You can't flee the"
	line "Union. The Union"
	para "is an idea. Also a"
	line "very big wall."
	done


