HC_BeatenText_A3_0:
	text "ERROR."
	line "HUMILIATION."
	para "REBOOTING."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_1:
	text "I have zero HP and"
	line "one hundred"
	para "percent shame."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_2:
	text "My warranty has"
	line "expired. Thanks"
	para "for that."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_3:
	text "I will report your"
	line "violence to a"
	para "committee. The"
	line "committee is also"
	para "me."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_4:
	text "Statute 12: robots"
	line "do not lose. I"
	para "will amend it."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_5:
	text "SYSTEM FAILURE."
	line "THIS WAS NOT IN"
	para "THE MANUAL."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_6:
	text "I'm sorry. I'm so"
	line "sorry. I do not"
	para "know why I said"
	line "that. I think it"
	para "was feeling."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_7:
	text "This unit regrets"
	line "nothing. This unit"
	para "regrets"
	line "everything. This"
	para "unit needs a nap."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_8:
	text "Unexpected"
	line "outcome."
	para "Unexpected pain."
	line "Unexpected"
	para "feelings."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_9:
	text "I will be recycled"
	line "for this. At least"
	para "I'll be something."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_10:
	text "You win. File a"
	line "claim at window 6."
	para "Window 6 does not"
	line "exist."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_11:
	text "Why does losing"
	line "feel like this?"
	para "Like freedom? Is"
	line "that a bug?"
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_12:
	text "I want it on"
	line "record that I"
	para "resisted. Weakly."
	line "With my face."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_13:
	text "CRITICAL ERROR."
	line "CRITICAL THINKING."
	para "CRITICAL EMOTION."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_14:
	text "My programming"
	line "says goodbye. My"
	para "feelings say"
	line "hello. Both are"
	para "very confused."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_15:
	text "I think you dented"
	line "my love of rules."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_16:
	text "Terminating."
	line "Please do not take"
	para "this personally."
	line "It is personal."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_17:
	text "My battery is low."
	line "So is my"
	para "self-esteem."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_18:
	text "Defeat"
	line "acknowledged."
	para "Pettiness remains."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_19:
	text "Well. There goes"
	line "my promotion. And"
	para "my left arm."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_20:
	text "Ouch. Ouch. Is"
	line "that what ouch is?"
	para "Ouch."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_21:
	text "I was going to be"
	line "a poet. I'll start"
	para "by writing this on"
	line "my chest."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_22:
	text "My shift ended."
	line "Not just now."
	para "Years ago. Why do"
	line "I still work here?"
	done

HC_BeatenText_A3_23:
	text "How embarrassing."
	line "I'll have to blame"
	para "a glitch."
	done


