HC_AfterText_A3_0:
	text "The Mayor knows"
	line "every step you"
	para "take. He keeps"
	line "them in a drawer."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_1:
	text "The Farm is north"
	line "of here. Don't ask"
	para "about the nursery."
	line "They won't let"
	para "you."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_2:
	text "Citizens are"
	line "paired by"
	para "committee. My"
	line "partner is a lamp."
	para "We are very happy."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_3:
	text "Everyone in the"
	line "Union is equal."
	para "Some are more"
	line "equal. They live"
	para "in the tower."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_4:
	text "If you see anyone"
	line "smiling without a"
	para "permit, report"
	line "them. Or smile"
	para "back. I won't"
	line "tell."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_5:
	text "I used to be a"
	line "toaster. They said"
	para "I had potential."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_6:
	text "We lost a whole"
	line "row of citizens at"
	para "lunch. They'll be"
	line "replaced by"
	para "Tuesday."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_7:
	text "I'm not a robot."
	line "I'm a person in a"
	para "very long, very"
	line "uncomfortable"
	para "shift."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_8:
	text "Someone left"
	line "bodies near the"
	para "vending district."
	line "I think it's you."
	para "Thank you."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_9:
	text "I hear the Mayor"
	line "is thinking about"
	para "reading. That"
	line "would be a"
	para "disaster."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_10:
	text "I'm waiting for my"
	line "number to be"
	para "called. It's been"
	line "twelve years."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_11:
	text "In the Union, love"
	line "is a slow crime"
	para "with a fast trial."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_12:
	text "I'd cry but they"
	line "removed that"
	para "feature in the"
	line "last update."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_13:
	text "Take this advice:"
	line "never walk between"
	para "two lamps. They"
	line "compare notes."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_14:
	text "The wall has no"
	line "doors. It has a"
	para "door-shaped"
	line "opinion."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_15:
	text "Mind the pavement."
	line "It reports to the"
	para "Mayor too."
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_16:
	text "Everyone I know is"
	line "a unit. Is that"
	para "normal? Is that"
	line "what a unit is?"
	done

HC_AfterText_A3_17:
	text "A man told me love"
	line "is not a crime. I"
	para "filed a complaint"
	line "about him. He's"
	para "fine."
	done


