HC_SeenText_A4_0:
	text "Welcome to"
	line "paradise! Have you"
	para "tried forgetting?"
	line "I forgot why I'm"
	para "fighting you."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_1:
	text "Smile! It's"
	line "mandatory. So is"
	para "losing."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_2:
	text "Pain is illegal"
	line "here. Your face is"
	para "therefore a crime."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_3:
	text "My subscription"
	line "includes a pool,"
	para "happiness and no"
	line "memory of my"
	para "children. Great"
	line "deal."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_4:
	text "Do you have a"
	line "grief license? No?"
	para "I'll have to take"
	line "your sadness. By"
	para "force."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_5:
	text "I used to cry. Now"
	line "I fight. Same"
	para "thing, fewer"
	line "tears."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_6:
	text "You're so tense."
	line "Let me help you"
	para "relax. With"
	line "violence."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_7:
	text "I can't remember"
	line "my name. I"
	para "remember yours:"
	line "it's the guy I'm"
	para "about to beat."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_8:
	text "I forgot why I'm"
	line "angry. Now I'm"
	para "angry about that."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_9:
	text "Sunscreen is"
	line "optional. Sunburn"
	para "is a subscription"
	line "tier."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_10:
	text "Everything is all"
	line "inclusive here."
	para "Even the regret."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_11:
	text "Hey, you look sad."
	line "Want a refill on"
	para "that?"
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_12:
	text "My grief used to"
	line "weigh a ton. They"
	para "sold it back to me"
	line "by the gram. Now I"
	para "fight lighter."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_13:
	text "I took the"
	line "jealousy package."
	para "I took the guilt"
	line "package. I took"
	para "the package. I"
	line "forgot what's in"
	para "it."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_14:
	text "I'm so happy. I'm"
	line "so happy. Why am I"
	para "so happy? I'm so"
	line "happy."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_15:
	text "We are all very"
	line "relaxed here."
	para "Relaxed people are"
	line "very efficient"
	para "fighters."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_16:
	text "I haven't felt a"
	line "thing in eleven"
	para "months. Come on."
	line "Make me."
	done

HC_SeenText_A4_17:
	text "I paid four"
	line "hundred a month to"
