HC_BeatenText_A5_0:
	text "Dead again. It"
	line "gets easier. It"
	para "really doesn't."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_1:
	text "I deserve that."
	line "All of that."
	para "Sorry. Thank you."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_2:
	text "I'll see you at"
	line "the next circle."
	para "I'll be the one in"
	line "the dumpster."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_3:
	text "My ledger is"
	line "wrong. I'm sure of"
	para "it. Please check."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_4:
	text "Well. That's"
	line "another stamp in"
	para "my permanent"
	line "record."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_5:
	text "I'd say 'go to"
	line "hell', but you're"
	para "already there."
	line "Welcome."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_6:
	text "That was"
	line "cathartic. I'm"
	para "going to cry now."
	line "Then complain."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_7:
	text "Down here, a loss"
	line "is a promotion."
	para "Thank you."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_8:
	text "I knew I should've"
	line "been nicer to the"
	para "guards."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_9:
	text "My fingers are"
	line "frozen. And my"
	para "pride. And my left"
	line "foot."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_10:
	text "The cold is in my"
	line "bones. You are in"
	para "my bones. Please"
	line "leave."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_11:
	text "I'm so bored."
	line "Thank you for the"
	para "entertainment."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_12:
	text "Take my coat. It"
	line "has a hole in it."
	para "And a body."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_13:
	text "You killed me."
	line "That's the most"
	para "anyone's cared in"
	line "decades."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_14:
	text "Fine. Fine! I'll"
	line "write an angry"
	para "letter. It will"
	line "arrive in a"
	para "century."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_15:
	text "It's a good thing"
	line "I'm already dead."
	para "Otherwise that"
	line "would've hurt."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_16:
	text "My team is"
	line "pathetic. Like me."
	para "Like everyone"
	line "here."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_17:
	text "I once got a stern"
	line "talking-to by the"
	para "Devil. It was"
	line "gentler."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_18:
	text "Cocytus is cold."
	line "Cold is a fact."
	para "You're a fact. A"
	line "cold, brutal fact."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_19:
	text "I won't tell"
	line "anyone. Nobody"
	para "will believe me."
	line "They never do."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_20:
	text "Guilt is an ice."
	line "It melts."
	para "Eventually."
	line "Hopefully. Please."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A5_21:
	text "That was awful. Do"
	line "it again."
	done


