HC_AfterText_A5_0:
	text "The ice cracks at"
	line "night. Don't walk"
	para "near the cracks."
	line "They sound like"
	para "names."
	done

HC_AfterText_A5_1:
	text "I'd leave, but the"
	line "gate is the other"
	para "way. Also it's"
	line "locked. Also it's"
	para "on fire."
	done

HC_AfterText_A5_2:
	text "Everyone down here"
	line "is waiting for"
	para "something. The"
	line "wait is the"
	para "punishment."
	done

HC_AfterText_A5_3:
	text "Dis is a city of"
	line "walls. Every wall"
	para "has a rumor. Every"
	line "rumor is about"
	para "you."
	done

HC_AfterText_A5_4:
	text "The Sleeper is in"
	line "the middle. We all"
	para "pretend not to"
	line "know. He's been"
	para "snoring for"
	line "centuries."
	done

HC_AfterText_A5_5:
	text "I was warned about"
	line "you. By myself. In"
	para "a dream. I didn't"
	line "listen."
	done

HC_AfterText_A5_6:
	text "You're the first"
	line "killer in a"
	para "thousand years who"
	line "didn't ask for"
	para "forgiveness."
	done

HC_AfterText_A5_7:
	text "Please step over"
	line "the dead. They're"
	para "in a bad mood."
	done

HC_AfterText_A5_8:
	text "The lake is not a"
	line "lake. It's an"
	para "opinion."
	done

HC_AfterText_A5_9:
	text "There's a man at"
	line "the center. They"
	para "say he sleeps and"
	line "rewrote the world."
	para "I say he's just"
	line "lazy."
	done

HC_AfterText_A5_10:
	text "I was a poet once."
	line "Now I'm a"
	para "footnote. In ice."
	done

HC_AfterText_A5_11:
	text "The Devil, they"
	line "say, is a very sad"
	para "man. It's okay."
	line "He's busy."
	done

HC_AfterText_A5_12:
	text "I think the lake"
	line "knows my name. I"
	para "asked it to"
	line "forget. It said"
	para "no."
	done

HC_AfterText_A5_13:
	text "I miss my mother."
	line "I miss my dog. I"
	para "miss being alive."
	line "In that order."
	done

HC_AfterText_A5_14:
	text "You're going to"
	line "make it. I can"
	para "feel it. Or maybe"
	line "that's frostbite."
	done

HC_AfterText_A5_15:
	text "Dis has a rule: no"
	line "running. I broke"
	para "it. Now I run"
	line "forever. It's"
	para "great cardio."
	done


